{
  "narrative": "Lantern Row Realty LLC currently has a Low risk score of 23 out of 100, but urgent security gaps in your real estate systems could allow criminals to disrupt your business operations or scam your clients. Our assessment found six stolen employee accounts from external data breaches, missing email authentication settings, and active software vulnerabilities that leave your business exposed. To protect your business, your IT team must immediately require password resets, implement email defenses, and update vulnerable software.",
